  "statement": "Compute the prime factorization of 1007021035035021007001 . (You should write your answer in the form \\(p_{1}^{e_{1}} p_{2}^{e_{2}} \\ldots p_{k}^{e_{k}}\\), where \\(p_{1}, \\ldots, p_{k}\\) are distinct prime numbers and \\(e_{1}, \\ldots, e_{k}\\) are positive integers.)",
