      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2013-p11.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\(7^{7} \\cdot 11^{7} \\cdot 13^{7}\\) The number in question is\n\n\\[\\sum_{i=0}^{7}\\binom{7}{i} 1000^{i}=(1000+1)^{7}=1001^{7}=7^{7} \\cdot 11^{7} \\cdot 13^{7}\\]",
